</facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078782" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro Celeberrimo atque Incomparabili
      <lb/>Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Est quod Tibi promisi Vir Celeberrime. <rs key="biblio_DHVYFVAZ" type="biblio">Anno<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
      <lb break="no"/>tationes</rs> eruditissimas <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimi</expan></choice> Agnati Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nico<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lai</rs> a me in <rs key="place_GEO-3165083" type="place">Tuscanam</rs> linguam versas atque
      <lb/><rs type="biblio">Diarii Veneti Tom. XX</rs> insertas ad vos trans<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mitto ut videatis quanta sit existimatio, qua<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lisque sit amor, quibus erga vos feror. <choice><orig>ex</orig><reg>Ex</reg></choice> istis
      <lb/>annotationibus videbunt Itali quis sit quidque
      <lb/>in sublimiori Geometria possit Doctissimus
      <lb/>Agnatus Tuus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus</rs>, pro quo non deseram om<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nia mea officia coram meis M<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cenatibus
      <lb/>ut tandem eum agnoscant vocentque ad edocen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dum, siquidem de tuo adventu prorsus despe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ramus magno cum totius <rs key="place_KON-italie" type="place">Itali<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> dolore. Te etiam
      <lb/>atque etiam rogo, si per otium licebit, ut
      <lb/>responsiones aliquas ad me mittas super proble<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>matibus physico-mechanicis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in <rs key="B_991170515018705501" type="letter">antecedentibus
      <lb/>meis epistolis</rs> Tibi demiss<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> proposui.</p> <closer><salute>Vale
      <lb/>Vir Celeberrime cum <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Clarississimo</expan></choice> Agnato Tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao</rs>
      <lb/>cui salutem plurimam mitto.</salute> <dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs>
      <lb/><date when="1715-06-08">Sexto Idus Iunii MDCCXV.</date></dateline></closer>
